    "detailed_description": "The city-fortress of Brams is renowned throughout the world as the home of the greatest wizards in existence: the Mage Lords. While inaccessible to most, the Mage Lords are now recruiting mages to join their ranks<br><br>Joining Brams is not just about prestige. Within the walls of the city-fortress you will gain access to the greatest arcane library in the world, countless experimental laboratories, equipment and reagents, and training from the most knowledgeable and powerful mages in existence, all of whom expand their knowledge and power so that they may one day ascend beyond the mortal realm.<br><br>Whether you are a seasoned archmage or sort of kind of a magic user on the side, all are welcomed to take the trials given to them by the remaining six Mage Lords, with those whose performance is found satisfactory being offered a seat among them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.poster.avif?t=1713383286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.webm?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.mp4?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Mage Lords of Brams is a &quot;bullet heaven&quot;/&quot;reverse bullet hell&quot; roguelite. Slaughter countless fantasy enemies with your powerful spells, powers and artifacts while gathering research scrolls to improve future runs inbetween levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.poster.avif?t=1713383286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.webm?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.mp4?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Content:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 playable regular races (Human, Dwarf, Orc, High Elf, Wood Elf, Dark Elf, Naiad, Troll and Vampire) with unique abilities<br></li><li>6 Monster Race/class with unique weapon and abilities<br></li><li> 40 Armaments (weapons, spells, artifacts and powers) from meteors, spectral axes and lightning bolts to undead and elemental armies<br></li><li> 40 Classes (Paladin, Valkyrie, War Wizard, Battlemage, Necromancer, Hierarch, Spirit Guide, Pyromancer, Illusionist, Lunar Knight, Alchemist and many many more)<br></li><li> 18 passive skills <br></li><li> Use the Library to improve 35 stats with scrolls dropped randomly by enemies<br></li><li> Cards of various qualities show up every level-up, adding an additional layer of complexity: the one you want might not offer the best attribute boost.<br></li><li>6 Main Levels + 6 secret mini levels<br></li><li>Genie market and trinket system allowing further customization every run<br></li><li>10 Ultimate spells. Give enemies a soul scorching Glimpse of Hell, pacify them into near uselessness with Love and Peace or tear coins out of their writhing bodies with Midas' Envious Gaze.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The city-fortress of Brams is renowned throughout the world as the home of the greatest wizards in existence: the Mage Lords. While inaccessible to most, the Mage Lords are now recruiting mages to join their ranks<br><br>Joining Brams is not just about prestige. Within the walls of the city-fortress you will gain access to the greatest arcane library in the world, countless experimental laboratories, equipment and reagents, and training from the most knowledgeable and powerful mages in existence, all of whom expand their knowledge and power so that they may one day ascend beyond the mortal realm.<br><br>Whether you are a seasoned archmage or sort of kind of a magic user on the side, all are welcomed to take the trials given to them by the remaining six Mage Lords, with those whose performance is found satisfactory being offered a seat among them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.poster.avif?t=1713383286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.webm?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/6ebd59714cc7b76e088c52f1a2c5b8ab.mp4?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Mage Lords of Brams is a &quot;bullet heaven&quot;/&quot;reverse bullet hell&quot; roguelite. Slaughter countless fantasy enemies with your powerful spells, powers and artifacts while gathering research scrolls to improve future runs inbetween levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.poster.avif?t=1713383286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.webm?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078710/extras/2caec2593b64a9864db7646a01725d7d.mp4?t=1713383286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Content:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 playable regular races (Human, Dwarf, Orc, High Elf, Wood Elf, Dark Elf, Naiad, Troll and Vampire) with unique abilities<br></li><li>6 Monster Race/class with unique weapon and abilities<br></li><li> 40 Armaments (weapons, spells, artifacts and powers) from meteors, spectral axes and lightning bolts to undead and elemental armies<br></li><li> 40 Classes (Paladin, Valkyrie, War Wizard, Battlemage, Necromancer, Hierarch, Spirit Guide, Pyromancer, Illusionist, Lunar Knight, Alchemist and many many more)<br></li><li> 18 passive skills <br></li><li> Use the Library to improve 35 stats with scrolls dropped randomly by enemies<br></li><li> Cards of various qualities show up every level-up, adding an additional layer of complexity: the one you want might not offer the best attribute boost.<br></li><li>6 Main Levels + 6 secret mini levels<br></li><li>Genie market and trinket system allowing further customization every run<br></li><li>10 Ultimate spells. Give enemies a soul scorching Glimpse of Hell, pacify them into near uselessness with Love and Peace or tear coins out of their writhing bodies with Midas' Envious Gaze.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mage Lords of Brams is an action roguelite where you slaughter countless fantasy enemies with your powerful spells, powers and artifacts while gathering scrolls to improve future runs between levels. Secrets to be found and thousands of race/class/ability combinations allow for endless variety.",
